{
  "$schema": "../../scenario.schema.json",
  "id": "tasks/a-failed-task-s-exception-keeps-its-attributes",
  "title": "A task whose worker's provider refused keeps the refusal's attributes on its exception, its text led by the provider and its status; an agent's delivery its provider's error failed before its turn is not retryable",
  "rules": [
    "§23.3 step 6",
    "§6.4",
    "§10.6.8",
    "§5.13"
  ],
  "notes": "Python: tests/test_provider_error_names_provider.py (str(ProviderError) leads with its provider and status), turns/_error_codec.py error_record (attributes: the error's JSON attributes, a ProviderError's retryable, provider, status_code, context_overflow and before_request), core/mixins/lane_execution.py _delivery_error (retryable as the raised error's retryable, true when it has none). The worker's provider mock refuses with status 503: the task fails with the provider's text, and its exception, read by the turn's host through wait_task, carries the refusal's attributes. The clerk's budget-aware memory finds the message alone past its window and raises a ProviderError, not retryable, before the turn: the message's delivery to the clerk fails with code ProviderError, not retryable. A scripted model's refusal fails the turn's stream instead, which the result's error reports, its delivery result not kept.",
  "setup": {
    "channels": [
      {
        "id": "email",
        "type": "email",
        "category": "transport"
      },
      {
        "id": "sms",
        "type": "sms",
        "category": "transport"
      },
      {
        "id": "worker",
        "type": "ai",
        "model": {
          "rounds": [
            {
              "refuses": {
                "status": 503,
                "message": "upstream unavailable",
                "provider": "mock"
              }
            },
            {
              "refuses": {
                "status": 503,
                "message": "upstream unavailable",
                "provider": "mock"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "clerk",
        "type": "ai",
        "category": "intelligence",
        "model": {
          "rounds": [
            {
              "text": "never"
            }
          ]
        },
        "memory": {
          "budget_aware": {
            "max_context_tokens": 5,
            "min_events": 1
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "boss",
        "type": "ai",
        "category": "intelligence",
        "on_event": [
          {
            "when": {
              "text": "go"
            },
            "do": [
              {
                "call": "host.delegate",
                "room_id": "parent",
                "agent_id": "worker",
                "task": "Find it.",
                "as": "d1",
                "expect": {
                  "result": {
                    "$present": true
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "call": "host.wait_task",
                "task_id": "$d1",
                "as": "d1_waited",
                "expect": {
                  "result": {
                    "result": {
                      "status": "failed",
                      "error": "mock (503): upstream unavailable"
                    },
                    "exception": {
                      "kind": {
                        "$contains": "ProviderError"
                      },
                      "message": "mock (503): upstream unavailable",
                      "attributes": {
                        "retryable": false,
                        "provider": "mock",
                        "status_code": 503,
                        "context_overflow": null,
                        "before_request": false
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rooms": [
      {
        "id": "parent",
        "bindings": [
          {
            "channel_id": "email"
          },
          {
            "channel_id": "boss"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "desk",
        "bindings": [
          {
            "channel_id": "sms"
          },
          {
            "channel_id": "clerk"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "call": "delegate",
      "room_id": "parent",
      "agent_id": "worker",
      "task": "Find it.",
      "wait": true,
      "expect": {
        "result": {
          "status": "failed",
          "result": {
            "status": "failed",
            "error": "mock (503): upstream unavailable"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "idle": true
    },
    {
      "call": "process_inbound",
      "room_id": "parent",
      "message": {
        "channel_id": "email",
        "sender_id": "alice@example.com",
        "content": {
          "type": "text",
          "body": "go"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "idle": true
    },
    {
      "call": "process_inbound",
      "room_id": "desk",
      "message": {
        "channel_id": "sms",
        "sender_id": "+15551234567",
        "content": {
          "type": "text",
          "body": "Please read this long message about my order, which is late."
        }
      },
      "expect": {
        "result": {
          "blocked": false,
          "delivery_results": {
            "clerk": {
              "status": "failed",
              "error": {
                "code": "ProviderError",
                "message": {
                  "$contains": "exceeds the model's context window"
                },
                "retryable": false
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "idle": true
    }
  ]
}
